id=victortaskbar_priv
name=VictorTaskbar Privileged (optional)
version=v0.1.0
versionCode=1
author=Don Victor / Victorious93
description=OPTIONAL. Installs VictorTaskbar (com.victorious.taskbar) systemlessly as a privileged system app so recent apps work without the manual usage-access toggle. Magisk, KernelSU and APatch. The app works without this module.
